  "title": "ASE Kaohsiung Plant Receives the National Sustainable Development Award, Earning National-Level Recognition for Two Consecutive Years",
  "summary": "The Kaohsiung plant distinguished itself among 147 nominees nationwide this year, earning further recognition for its sustainability achievements. The award was presented by Vice Premier Cheng Li-Chiun on August 8, marking ASE’s second consecutive year of receiving national-level recognition. The accolade underscores the Group’s leadership in advancing net-zero initiatives and its commitment to addressing the global challenge of climate change.",
